    "text": "Jon-Michael's method helped me lose 30 pounds and I am still losing weight.  This is how he helped me.\n\nI have a very busy schedule: I work at least 60 hours a week in a high-stress, fast-paced environment, and when my work day is over, all I want to do is spend time with my wife and 8-month old son.  In other words, I don't have much time to devote to anything besides work and family, let alone a time-demanding workout regime or gym membership.\n\nWhen I first approached Jon-Michael and asked for his help I couldn't have been more wrong about what I needed to accomplish my goal.  Because of my busy schedule I assumed that I would only be able to concentrate on losing weight if I were on vacation or while I had time off work while transitioning between jobs.  When Jon-Michael guided me, I quickly learned that his method can be incorporated into any schedule, any lifestyle, and any one can be successful.\n\nThe best part about Jon-Michael's method is that it is an array of tools that can be used for the rest of your life.  His method is not a trendy diet fad or gimmicky workout routine that you try for a month and then relapse.  It makes sense and works because your body will naturally transition into the healthiest way of living it has ever been.  He will tailor your habits and spot your weaknesses and strengthen your health to give you the body you want and the change you need.  I would recommend Jon-Michael's guidance to anyone I know that is serious about losing weight and making a positive change in their health."
